      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: white girls stepped their game up; hasOverallIntent: mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person in a revealing outfit with text that reads 'white girls stepped their game up.' The visual focus is on the body, particularly the buttocks and thighs, which is a common trope in misogynistic memes that objectify women by emphasizing their physical appearance. The phrase 'stepped their game up' is used in a context that implies sexualization or hypersexualization, which aligns with misogynistic content that reduces women to their physical attributes. This meme uses the juxtaposition of the image and text to reinforce a stereotype that objectifies women, particularly white women, by focusing on their bodies in a sexualized manner. The intent is to provoke a reaction based on the sexualization of the female body, which is a form of misogynistic content.",
